    "text": "「天宮るり」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「こんなところに、いたの？　何してるの、みんな捜してたんだけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「不意に姿を消さないで。あなたしか車の運転はできないんだから、帰りのことも考えるとあなたが必要。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どこかに行かれたら、困る」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「気まぐれでも、あなたが拾ったんだから。責任をもって、最後まで運んで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「それだけ、言いにきたの。『奇跡の天文現象』を見たくないなら、べつにいい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どこへでも、山奥にでも……。トイレのなかにでも、拗ねて引きこもっていればいい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どこにいても。わたしが、あなたを見つける。車の運転をさせる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「役目を果たさせる、歩いて帰るには遠すぎるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あの子が、風邪をひいてしまうから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「それだけ。じゃあ、ね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「居場所がわかったならいい、あとはもう好きにして」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
