    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「……心配して捜しにきてくれた、わけじゃないんですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「当たり前。わたしは、あなたのことが大嫌い」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「むかしのわたしを、思いだすから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「浮き世離れした、変わりもの。誰にも愛されない、電波女だったわたしを」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「るりの呼吸音や、足音を記憶していて、だから居場所がわかったんですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「『ゆんゆん』のひと。相変わらず、耳がいいですね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「……『耳がいいだけのひと』のくせに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「そう。わたしは、『耳がいいだけのひと』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「それを認めるのが怖くて、ちゃんと直視しなくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「その『ちょっとした個性』を恐ろしく、禍々しいものだと思いこんでいた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「ううん。そう信じたかった、自分は特別な存在で……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「そんな自分にしかできないことがあって、そのためには世界中のどんなものだって犠牲にしていいんだって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「そう思いこんでた、勘違いしていた。わたしは、悪い人間だった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「ううん。傲慢な、子供だった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-f-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-f-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「だけど。そんなわたしを、自分から他人を遠ざけてるだけなのに……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「孤高に振る舞っているつもりで、自己陶酔をしていたわたしの、目を覚まさせてくれたひとがいたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「見つけてくれた、ひとがいたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あったかい、優しいひとが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あのひとの、そばにいたいと思ったの。そのために、努力をした。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「自分で登った針山のてっぺんから、一歩ずつ、あのひとに手を引かれて地上へと舞い降りた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「今のわたしは、あなたが興味を示さない、退屈で平凡な『ふつうの女』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「『耳がいいだけのひと』ですらない、わたしはとっくに『ただのひと』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「『ひと』は変われる。あなただって、きっと」"
  },
